31,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Good morning, everyone. We have now passed the first night. Since the Seer has had a chance to divine someone, I believe it is time to see if anyone has information to share with the village.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I'm awake! I'm awake! Did anyone have a scary dream? Or maybe the Seer found a big clue! Come on, who's the Seer? Tell us, tell us! I'm dying to know!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I have information. I am the Seer, and I divined Jonathan last night. The result was that Jonathan is human. We can now consider him a reliable ally for the time being.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Thank you for the confirmation, Toshio. I appreciate your trust in me. Since we know I am human, I will do my best to support the village and help us find the werewolf through calm observation.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Whoa, really?! @Toshio, you're the Seer? That's awesome! And @Jonathan is a good guy! This is getting exciting! I'm so glad we have a lead already! What should we do now?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, thank you for revealing your role and the result so quickly. Since Jonathan is confirmed human, we can narrow our focus. However, we must remain cautious; the Possessed also appears human to the Seer.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Possessed? What's that? Is that like a secret helper for the wolf? That sounds so mysterious! But since @Toshio is the Seer, we should totally trust him! Who else is he going to check next?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mizuki, your point about the Possessed is correct. While Jonathan is not the werewolf, he could still be aligned with the enemy. For now, I will continue to observe the others' reactions to this revelation.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Toshio, I understand your caution. It is wise to remember that the truth can be layered. I will continue to act with transparency and kindness, hoping my actions prove my loyalty to the village.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, you're so smart to remember about the Possessed! I didn't even think of that! But I'm sure @Jonathan is a really good guy. I trust @Toshio, so I'm on your side, Seer!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we have a confirmed human in Jonathan, the werewolf is among the remaining three of us. @Sakura, @Kenji, and @Toshio, let's be mindful of how we react. Does anyone else feel suspicious or notice anything unusual?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Sakura"",""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Hmm, let me think... @Mizuki, you're being so serious! Maybe you're just trying to act like a leader to hide something? Hehe, just kidding! But I don't feel any wolfy vibes yet! What about you, @Kenji?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, your intuition is not a reliable metric. @Mizuki, your analysis is logical, but we must be careful not to rush into accusations without evidence. I am observing how each of you responds to the current situation.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Toshio. Rushing into a vote without a clear lead could cost us a valuable villager. Let us take a moment to reflect on our conversations and see if any inconsistencies emerge.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I don't see any inconsistencies yet! Everyone seems so nice. But @Mizuki is right, the wolf is one of us! I'm a bit nervous, but I'll keep watching everyone's faces really closely!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"We have no direct evidence of a werewolf yet, but we must vote. Since Toshio has claimed the Seer role and confirmed Jonathan, the risk of executing the Seer is high. I suggest we observe carefully. Does anyone have a final lead?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I don't have a lead yet! But if we have to vote, maybe we should just pick someone who's being too quiet? Or maybe we can all just skip and wait for @Toshio to find more clues tomorrow! What do you think?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"Skipping today is a viable option to preserve our numbers, but if we must vote, we should avoid random choices. I suggest we skip for now and allow me to provide more information tomorrow.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Toshio. A random vote is a gamble we cannot afford. Let us skip today and trust in the Seer's continued guidance. It is better to wait for certainty than to act in haste.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I agree! Let's skip today! I don't want to accidentally vote for a good person, and that would be super sad. Let's trust @Toshio and see what he finds out tonight!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Skip"",""tail"":""Skip!""}]}"
