64,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Oh no! Mizuki is gone! That's so scary! Who could have done such a mean thing? I'm actually shaking a little bit! @Toshio, did you find out anything new last night? Please tell us!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"I divined Mizuki last night, and the result was that she was human. Her death confirms that the werewolf is among the remaining three of us: Sakura, Kenji, or Jonathan.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Sakura"",""Kenji"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a tragedy that Mizuki has been taken from us. Her loss is a reminder of the danger we face. @Toshio, thank you for the information; it further narrows our search.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Mizuki was so helpful! I can't believe she's gone! @Toshio, thank you for checking her. Now it's really down to us... this is getting super scary! Who do you think did it?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"Wait, @Toshio said the wolf is one of us three? That means it's me, @Kenji, or @Jonathan! But I'm just a little girl! I can't be a scary wolf! @Jonathan, you're so calm, is that because you know something?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, your age or demeanor is irrelevant to the role you hold. @Jonathan, your composure is consistent, but we must consider if that calmness is a mask. I am currently analyzing the patterns of your responses.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"My calmness is simply my nature, Sakura. I find that a quiet mind is more capable of seeing the truth. I have no secrets to hide, and I hope we can find the werewolf together without losing anyone else.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, don't be scared! I'm sure you're not the wolf! But @Toshio is right, we have to be careful. @Jonathan, you really are super calm! It's kind of amazing, but maybe a little bit spooky too?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Toshio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, @Kenji thinks it's spooky too! Maybe @Jonathan is a super-secret wolf who's just really good at pretending to be a gentleman! @Toshio, you're the Seer, so you have to tell us who's the bad guy! Who's next on your list?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Jonathan"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,3,talk,Toshio,,I have already divined Jonathan and Mizuki. Both were human. This means the werewolf must be either Sakura or Kenji. I am now weighing which of you two is more likely to be the wolf.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki"",""Sakura"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"If Toshio's divinations are true, the circle has narrowed significantly. @Sakura, @Kenji, I hope you both understand the gravity of the situation. Let us remain honest so the village may prevail.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Sakura"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"What?! Me or Sakura?! No way! @Toshio, are you sure? I'm just a kid, I couldn't be a scary werewolf! I've been trying so hard to help! Please, you have to believe me, I'm a good guy!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"Wait, wait! @Toshio, you can't just say it's me or @Kenji! That's not fair! We're both just trying our best! Maybe the werewolf is actually the Seer and you're just tricking us? Hehe, just kidding! But please don't vote for me!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"The possibility of me being the werewolf is a common tactic to sow doubt, Sakura. However, the logic remains: Jonathan and Mizuki were human. Between you and Kenji, one of you is the wolf. I believe it is Sakura.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Jonathan"",""Mizuki"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Toshio has provided a clear logical path. If we trust his role as the Seer, the evidence points toward Sakura or Kenji. Sakura's attempts to deflect with humor are noted. I will trust the Seer's judgment.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Sakura"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, please don't do this! Why Sakura? I'm just as much of a suspect as she is! I can't believe you'd pick her just like that! Please, let's think about this again! I'm really a villager!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
